TITLE 1D transport, 10 cells, 10 shifts, cation exchange

SOLUTION 0  Initial solution
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

SOLUTION 1-10  Initial in all cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

SOLUTION 11  Influent solution
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001

EQUILIBRATE 1-10 with solution 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -dispersivities 0
    -correct_disp true
    -print_cells 1
    -print_frequency 1
    -punch_cells 1
    -punch_frequency 1
    -initial_time 0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
    -simulation true
    -state true
    -solution true
    -time true
    -step true
    -distance true

USER_PUNCH
    -headings Ca_m
10 PUNCH MOL("Ca+2")

END
